@attribute [Route($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Getting_Started}{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Roadmap}")]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Accordion @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Usage</PageTitle>


<section class="@Section.Base @Section.Radius(SectionRadius.Content) @Section.Background(SectionBackground.NeutralLighter) @Section.NoMarginBlock">

    <h1>@GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Roadmap</h1>

    <p>
        To some, the order of the components that have, and are being built may seem strange, but please remember the emphasis is on accessibility and the components released thus far (excluding the switch)
        are the ones that in my opinion can have the most impact on accessibility given how poorly they are generally implemented, if at all (from an accessibility standpoint), given there usage.
    </p>
    <p>
        I will also be building child components first, for example the DataTable required a Pager, a Debounce Filter and Actions Popover for row actions, as these  were standalone components 
        in there own right, they were built before the Data Table so the table could make use of them. The other factor I take into account is what I need for the site, for example the NavGroup component that was recently released.
    </p>
    <p>
        After the above, and in no particular order the following components will be developed. Please note all of the components will be fully functional, but may not have all the bells
        and whistles that paid-for components or component frameworks may have.
    </p>
    <p>
        I am focusing on accessibility and inclusivity but I will do my best to add any missing feature that the majority request. I apologise if you are a minority feature
        requester, but I can only do so much in the time I have and I would prefer to reach as wide an audience as I can first, then perhaps refine things.
    </p>
</section>
<section style="margin-block:var(--br-unit-space-5);">
    <h2 id="planned-components">Planned components</h2>

    <ul aria-labelledby="planned-components">
        <li>
            StarRating
        </li>
        <li>
            Heading
        </li>
        <li>
            ToolTip
        </li>
        <li>
            TreeView
        </li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        You are welcome to request a feature and/or a component that you feel should be on the list. To do so just visit the <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Class" target="_blank" href="https://github.com/BlazorRamp/Components/issues">Issues (opens in a new window)</a>
        section of the repo and from the new issue select the 'Feature request' option.
    </p>

</section>
<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Getting_Started}{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Accessibility}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Accessibility</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Accordion}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Overview}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Accordion - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>
